  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기, 손님. 괜찮으시다면\n택시를 이용해 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30002C0020C190B2D8002E0020AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA74000AD0DDC2DCB97C0020C774C6A9D5740020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 이제 막 택시 드라이버가 된 참이라\n아직 아무도 태워 본 적이 없거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C774C81C0020B9C90020D0DDC2DC0020B4DCB77CC774BC84AC000020B41C0020CC38C774B77C000AC544C9C10020C544BB34B3C40020D0DCC6CC0020BCF80020C801C7740020C5C6AC70B4E0C694002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 연습...이 아니라,\n조금 익숙해지고 싶어서요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C5F0C2B5002E002E002EC7740020C544B2C8B77C002C000AC870AE080020C775C219D574C9C0ACE00020C2F6C5B4C11CC694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요금은 안 내셔도 되니까\n제 택시의 손님이 되어 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694AE08C7400020C5480020B0B4C154B3C40020B418B2C8AE4C000AC81C0020D0DDC2DCC7580020C190B2D8C7740020B418C5B40020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되시면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418C2DCBA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 택시의 손님이 되어 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D0DDC2DCC7580020C190B2D8C7740020B418C5B40020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럴 수가... 사람 하나 살리는 셈 치고\n제 택시의 손님이 되어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F40020C218AC00002E002E002E0020C0ACB78C0020D558B0980020C0B4B9ACB2940020C1480020CE58ACE0000AC81C0020D0DDC2DCC7580020C190B2D8C7740020B418C5B40020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사합니다!\n제 인생 첫 손님이세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E40021000AC81C0020C778C0DD0020CCAB0020C190B2D8C774C138C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로즈 포켓몬센터",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CC9880020D3ECCF13BAACC13CD1300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 다른 곳은 안 가시나요?\n가다가 길을 헤맬 것 같아서요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020B2E4B9780020ACF3C7400020C5480020AC00C2DCB098C694003F000AAC00B2E4AC000020AE38C7440020D5E4B9EC0020AC830020AC19C544C11CC694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그, 그럼 출발하겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8002C0020ADF8B7FC0020CD9CBC1CD558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E40021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갈 수 있는 곳이 하나뿐인 택시라니,\n많이 놀라셨죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC080020C2180020C788B2940020ACF3C7740020D558B098BFD0C7780020D0DDC2DCB77CB2C8002C000AB9CEC7740020B180B77CC168C8E0003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "헤매지 않고 갈 자신이 있는 곳이\n딱 한 군데뿐이라서요... 죄송해요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5E4B9E4C9C00020C54AACE00020AC080020C790C2E0C7740020C788B2940020ACF3C774000AB5310020D55C0020AD70B370BFD0C774B77CC11CC694002E002E002E0020C8C4C1A1D574C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저, 저는... 가애 카페의\n딸기 타르트를 좋아해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002C0020C800B294002E002E002E0020AC00C5600020CE74D398C758000AB538AE300020D0C0B974D2B8B97C0020C88BC544D574C694002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 이러면 대화가 아니라 자기소개네요.\n죄송해요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020C774B7ECBA740020B300D654AC000020C544B2C8B77C0020C790AE30C18CAC1CB124C694002E000AC8C4C1A1D574C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거리에 야생 포켓몬이 늘어나서\n택시 운전도 힘들어졌어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70B9ACC5D00020C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B298C5B4B098C11C000AD0DDC2DC0020C6B4C804B3C40020D798B4E4C5B4C84CC5B4C694002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데도 어째서\n택시 드라이버가 됐냐면요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370B3C40020C5B4C9F8C11C000AD0DDC2DC0020B4DCB77CC774BC84AC000020B410B0D0BA74C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5570021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "길을 잘못 들어서 유턴할게요.\n죄송해요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE38C7440020C798BABB0020B4E4C5B4C11C0020C720D134D560AC8CC694002E000AC8C4C1A1D574C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어... 제가 택시 드라이버가 된 이유에 대해\n이야기하는 중이었죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4002E002E002E0020C81CAC000020D0DDC2DC0020B4DCB77CC774BC84AC000020B41C0020C774C720C5D00020B300D574000AC774C57CAE30D558B2940020C911C774C5C8C8E0003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5570021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도착했어요.\n로즈 포켓몬센터입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n약속대로 요금은 안 내셔도 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4CC29D588C5B4C694002E000AB85CC9880020D3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE00000AC57DC18DB300B85C0020C694AE08C7400020C5480020B0B4C154B3C40020B3FCC694002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드릴게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저야말로\n손님이 되어 주셔서 감사했습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C57CB9D0B85C000AC190B2D8C7740020B418C5B40020C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD588C2B5B2C8B2E4002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지... 진짜요...?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그럼, 요금은 710원입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0002E002E002E0020C9C4C9DCC694002E002E002E003F00100001BE01000AADF8B7FC002C0020C694AE08C7400020003700310030C6D0C785B2C8B2E4002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지... 진짜요...?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그럼, 요금은 710원입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저기...\n돈이 부족하신데요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0002E002E002E0020C9C4C9DCC694002E002E002E003F00100001BE01000AADF8B7FC002C0020C694AE08C7400020003700310030C6D0C785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE01000AC800AE30002E002E002E000AB3C8C7740020BD80C871D558C2E0B370C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님을 태워 보니까\n제가 얼마나 형편없는지 알 수 있었어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190B2D8C7440020D0DCC6CC0020BCF4B2C8AE4C000AC81CAC000020C5BCB9C8B0980020D615D3B8C5C6B294C9C00020C54C0020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "운전도 대화도 갈피를 못 잡고...\n매번 이러면 손님들이 불안해하실 거예요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B4C804B3C40020B300D654B3C40020AC08D53CB97C0020BABB0020C7A1ACE0002E002E002E000AB9E4BC880020C774B7ECBA740020C190B2D8B4E4C7740020BD88C548D574D558C2E40020AC70C608C694002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 포켓몬 승부에는 자신 있거든요.\n그래서 말인데, 저와 승부해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C5D0B2940020C790C2E00020C788AC70B4E0C694002E000AADF8B798C11C0020B9D0C778B370002C0020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손님, 저와 승부해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190B2D8002C0020C800C6400020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제게도 장점이 있다는 걸\n보여 드리겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC8CB3C40020C7A5C810C7740020C788B2E4B2940020AC78000ABCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러지 말고 승부해 주세요!\n저의 장점을 보여 드리고 싶단 말이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC9C00020B9D0ACE00020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC138C6940021000AC800C7580020C7A5C810C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACE00020C2F6B2E80020B9D0C774C5D0C6940021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
